# Vite frontend environment.
# Vite exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle.
# Only non-secret, intentionally public values belong here.
#
# Base URL of the Hungry Box API. Used from the API-integration phase onward.
# In development the value may be left unset (the Vite dev server proxies /api
# and /socket.io to http://localhost:3000). In production this must be the real
# API origin, e.g.:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://hungrybox-api.up.railway.app/api
#
# The Socket.IO client derives /realtime from the same origin, so the deployed
# frontend must be listed in the API's CORS_ORIGINS. HTTPS is required outside
# local development.